        <p>On Fri('ify night, a woman named Sarah Eltsahrth I Goatee, wile a • wittier, living at Ilay•lock, died suddenly in the yard of the New Market Inn. Earley- town. The woman had come to Harlestosvn market • lug, and not feeling Well went into the New Market Inn, for a stimulant. She sat &amp;Wen on .the stake, and as she felt no better, see w.dit out at, the yard, and immediately fell down. Dr. Valentine was at once summoned, but vile died soon after his arrival, from heart disease. Dr. Dowling has attetulttrl the woman at intervals tor tbe Ithe 5 yews for heart diseatte.</p>
